    "long_instructions": "##AI Testing\r\n\r\n1. Import the image from the backpack into the AI Chat on Level 2 and ask it to analyze what you have placed in the \"Original Image\" box. \r\n\r\n\r\n2.  Try several different prompts, such as \"Describe the person who lives here\", \"Where they go to school?\" and analyze the outputs. \r\n\r\n",
